      "value": "i've wanted something like this for a while. I would love to be able to set each favorite friend group as a different status.\n\nexample:\n\nBase status is orange\n\nFriend Group 1 is blue\n\nFriend Group 2 is green\n\nFriend Group 3 is Base (orange)\n\netc\n\nhaving an override status would be great too, to allow you to temporally change your status for every group without having to change them individually.\n\nexample:\n\noverride is Red\n\nBase status is orange, but shown as override (red)\n\nFriend Group 1 is blue, but shown as override (red)\n\nFriend Group 2 is green, but shown as override (red)\n\nFriend Group 3 is Base (orange), but shown as override (red)\n\netc",
      "viewerReactions": null,
