      "value": "I think it'd work quite well if you could add people to groups, and have a toggle for which groups can join you at the time\n\ngroup 1 : person1, person2, person3 - - Green\n\ngroup 2 : person4, person5, person6 - - Orange\n\ngroup 3 : Person7, person8, person9 - - Red\n\nwith the colours roughly matching the description of what is in-game already for status's description",
